# Styling

Design reference: `.cursor/.agents/skills/minimalist-ui/SKILL.md`

## Palette (Tailwind)

| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `canvas` | `#F7F6F3` | Page background |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, panels |
| `line` | `#EAEAEA` | Borders |
| `ink` | `#2F3437` | Primary text |
| `muted` | `#787774` | Secondary text |
| `status-on-text` | `#346538` | Active / green |
| `status-off-text` | `#9F2F2D` | Off-task / red |
| *(timeline)* | `#7CB87C` | Paid break (light green) |
| *(timeline)* | `#9CA3AF` | Unpaid break / lunch (gray) |
| *(timeline)* | `#6B5B95` | Meeting / SOS (purple) |

## Stack

```txt
MUI Theme     → Button, Table, Typography defaults
Tailwind      → @apply in SCSS modules
SCSS modules  → ComponentName.module.scss
```

## Rules

- Prefer `border border-line` over box shadows
- Use `font-mono` / `tabular-nums` for timestamps and metrics
- Avoid SCSS class names that collide with Tailwind utilities (e.g. use `.summary-grid` not `.grid`)
- MUI primary button: charcoal `#111111` via theme overrides
- Responsive: mobile-first (`flex-col sm:flex-row`)

## Do NOT

- Hardcode hex when theme/tailwind token exists
- Use heavy shadows (`shadow-lg`, etc.)
- Put feature styles in `src/styles/` (use module SCSS)
